/*
  CronParser.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0014 · CronParser (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  CronParser resolves (table "CronParser") lives here with its web `t(key, default)`
  English value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog
  at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface
  prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (features/admin/components/devtools/tools/CronParser.tsx). The "description fragments"
  group localizes the schedule sentence that the web helper (describeCron) emits as
  hardcoded English — assembled here so the native surface holds no English literals.
  The remainder back the native-only chrome (empty state, no-runs note, accessibility).
*/

